# Docs and Roadmap

Use these files as the current planning baseline:

- `docs/roadmap/v1-readiness-audit.md`
- `docs/roadmap/v1-closure-plan.md`
- `.agents/v1-scope.md`

When editing docs:

- Keep route names aligned with implementation.
- Mark roadmap items as done/partial only when code evidence exists.
- Do not document old auth/proxy behavior that trusts cookie presence as a valid session.
- Distinguish v1 blocking work from v1.1 and post-v1 polish.
- Keep setup docs explicit about local destructive seed behavior.
